title: NPC
---
Boy: Oh, hey! You must be the new person!

Boy: My name’s Charlie. What’s yours?

MC: My name’s MC name. What’re doing here?

Boy: My parents have gone inside the station to say goodbye to a friend, so I’m riding my bike. Wanna join?

MC: I think I’m a bit big for your bike, but maybe another time when I get a bike of my own!
<<player_look_at Character parent1>>

Man: Charlie, who’s this? Oh wait, you must be the newcomer!

Man: I’m Name. You’ve already met Charlie. And this is my wife Name and daughter Name.
<<player_look_at Character parent2>>

Wife: It’s nice to meet you finally. We’ve been excited to hear a new person was moving all the way out here. It not often you see a new face. What was your name again, love?

MC: My name’s Name. It’s good to see some friendly faces.
<<player_look_at Character parent1>>
Man: Well, if you ever need anything, please let us know. We own the local grocery store, so you will know where to find us.

Man: Well, we better get on now, it’s been a big day kids. Take care MC name.
===

